        "narration": "This war started at 9:02 and ended at 9:40. Zanzibar, 27 August 1896.",
        "visual_query": "zanzibar stone town harbour",
        "visual_fallback": "east african coast"
      },
      {
        "narration": "Two days earlier the pro-British sultan died. His nephew Khalid bin Barghash seized the palace before Britain could install its own man.",
