        "visual_fallback": "cannon smoke"
      },
      {
        "narration": "By 9:40 the palace flag was down. Khalid ran for the German consulate, Britain crowned its chosen sultan that afternoon, and roughly five hundred Zanzibaris were killed or wounded inside thirty-eight minutes.",
